.idea
target
node_modules
# A published reader in the wire-compat gate aborts rather than erroring on
# some malformed containers, and an abort drops a core file wherever the
# process was running. The name depends on kernel.core_pattern, which is `core`
# on some hosts and `core.<pid>` on others.
core
core.*
pkg_ibe.pub
pkg_ibe.sec
pkg_ibs.pub
pkg_ibs.sec
.env
*.pem
*.patch
# pg-wasm is under the root manifest's `exclude`, so the semver gate's
# `--manifest-path pg-wasm/Cargo.toml` resolves it on its own and writes a
# lockfile next to the manifest. The repo does not track it.
pg-wasm/Cargo.lock
